        "explanation": "<p>Since $y$ varies directly as $x$, $y = kx$. Given $y = 10$ when $x = 2$, $k = \\frac{10}{2} = 5$. Thus, when $x = 5$, $y = 5 \\times 5 = 25$.</p>",
